The gallery''s 2025 self-description lists Supper Club Hong Kong (2025), Feria Material (2024), June Art Fair (2023) and NADA Miami (2018 to 2021); Shimizu''s own two-person show with Calvin Miceli-Nelson (2021) is typical of how the space builds exhibitions from artist friendships made online.

For a visiting artist, 4649 is a small, informal room where the directors are often present; the gallery site is the contact route.', ARRAY['visual_art']::TEXT[], ARRAY['tyo-4649']::TEXT[], 'https://4-6-4-9.jp/', NULL, 'https://easteast.org/2025/?p=1073', '2026-10-20', 'active')
ON CONFLICT (curator_id) DO UPDATE SET about=EXCLUDED.about, affiliations=EXCLUDED.affiliations, website_url=EXCLUDED.website_url, evidence_url=EXCLUDED.evidence_url, verified_at=EXCLUDED.verified_at;

4649''s on-site programme brings emerging foreign artists to Tokyo; off-site it takes Tokyo artists to fairs and partner galleries (Supper Club Hong Kong 2025, Feria Material 2024, June Art Fair 2023, NADA Miami 2018 to 2021, Art Collaboration Kyoto 2022 with King''s Leap). The ''Onsen Confidential'' gallery-share invited galleries from Prague, Vienna, Paris, Tbilisi and Shanghai to show in Tokyo.

For a visiting artist, Takamizawa and his co-directors are the people to meet in the Sugamo cluster; the gallery site is the contact route.', ARRAY['visual_art']::TEXT[], ARRAY['tyo-4649']::TEXT[], 'https://4-6-4-9.jp/', NULL, 'https://easteast.org/2025/?p=1073', '2026-10-20', 'active')
