The company''s recent stage work includes ''Lemming / Song of Chaos'' (21 to 22 Feb 2026, Kyoto Prefectural Center for Arts and Culture), an improvised group piece restaged with young Kyoto dancers and a new score-based improvisation with music by Toru Yamanaka. Sakamoto received the Kyoto City New Artist Award in 2007.

For a visiting dancer, he is the person behind Kyoto''s contact-improv classes and jams; the company site is the contact route.', ARRAY['dance']::TEXT[], ARRAY['kyo-monochromecircus','kyo-kidwf','kyo-kac']::TEXT[], 'https://monochromecircus.com/', NULL, 'https://artscape.jp/article/57844/', '2026-10-20', 'active')
ON CONFLICT (curator_id) DO UPDATE SET about=EXCLUDED.about, affiliations=EXCLUDED.affiliations, website_url=EXCLUDED.website_url, evidence_url=EXCLUDED.evidence_url, verified_at=EXCLUDED.verified_at;

She performs in and assists the direction of the company''s group works, most recently ''Lemming / Song of Chaos'' (21 to 22 Feb 2026, Kyoto Prefectural Center for Arts and Culture), where she danced alongside a cast of young Kansai dancers. Monochrome Circus also runs contact-improv workshops and jams at Kyoto Art Center and is the organising company behind the Kyoto International Dance Workshop Festival (30th edition, 2026).

For a visiting dancer, Mori and Sakamoto are the way into Kyoto''s contact-improvisation community; the company site is the contact route.', ARRAY['dance']::TEXT[], ARRAY['kyo-monochromecircus','kyo-kidwf']::TEXT[], 'https://monochromecircus.com/', NULL, 'https://artscape.jp/article/57844/', '2026-10-20', 'active')
